horised</b> <b>use</b> of\n\n<b>electricity</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  covers", "docsize": 18903, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Karnataka High Court", "author": "A V Chandrashekara", "authorEncoded": "a-v-chandrashekara"}, {"tid": 95496082, "catids": null, "doctype": 1004, "publishdate": "2025-11-28", "authorid": 413, "bench": [413], "title": "Maharashtra State <b>Electricity</b> ... vs Hitesh Plastics And Ors on 28 November, 2025", "numcites": 10, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "Facts Establish <b>Unauthorised</b> <b>Use</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b> :\n \n  50.     On the material placed before the Court, the facts clearly\n establish <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> within ... assessment for <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>. Sub-<b>section</b> (5)\n directs the assessing officer to determine the period of\n <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b>. Sub-<b>section</b> (6) then clearly", "docsize": 62500, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Bombay High Court", "author": "A B Borkar", "authorEncoded": "a-b-borkar"}, {"tid": 181675448, "catids": null, "doctype": 1013, "publishdate": "2025-08-26", "authorid": null, "bench": null, "title": "C.K.Abdul Rahman vs The Kerala State <b>Electricity</b> Board on 26 August, 2025", "numcites": 11, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "effecting assessment under  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>  of the Act. For ready\n\nreference  <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>(1)  is extracted hereunder:-\n\n           &quot; <b>Section</b> <b>126</b> .      Assessment ... <b>Section</b> <b>126</b>(5)  is extracted\n\nhereunder: -\n \n                &quot; <b>Section</b> <b>126</b> . Assessment.........\n               (5) If the assessing officer reaches to the\n         conclusion that <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b>", "docsize": 37110, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Kerala High Court"}, {"tid": 92375460, "catids": null, "doctype": 1013, "publishdate": "2025-08-26", "authorid": null, "bench": nul